OL,3,GNEWSATemporary memorial put up to
OL,4,Aremember teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary memorial has been installed
OL,7,Fto remember a 16-year-old boy who died
OL,8,Fafter being stabbed in Peterborough.
OL,10,FBaye Bireme Fall, from the city, was
OL,11,Fattacked in Riseholme near the
OL,12,FOrtongate Shopping Centre just before
OL,13,F19:00 BST on 12 April.
OL,15,FThe original floral tribute and
OL,16,Fcandles, placed outside, were removed
OL,17,Fdue to fire safety concerns during the
OL,18,Fdry weather. Kirsty Knight,
OL,19,FConservative councillor for Orton
OL,20,FWaterville, replaced it with a wooden
OL,21,Fmemorial last week.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
