OL,3,GNEWSATemporary memorial put up to
OL,4,Aremember teen
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The wishing well is only temporary,
OL,7,Fand when the time feels right, the
OL,8,Ffamily can take it home and place it in
OL,9,Ftheir own garden," Knight said.
